OL,3,GNEWSACCTV released in hunt for gran's
OL,4,Akiller
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the murder of
OL,7,Fa grandmother have released CCTV
OL,8,Ffootage showing her in the days before
OL,9,Fshe was found dead at her home, ahead
OL,10,Fof the first anniversary of her death.
OL,12,FRose Johnston was 68 when she was
OL,13,Fdiscovered at her home on Ancroft Road
OL,14,Fin Dovecot, Liverpool, on 4 October
OL,15,Flast year with a blunt force head
OL,16,Finjury.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
